#
# Base: ColabDesign v1.1.3  (https://github.com/sokrypton/ColabDesign)
# Apply from the root of an installed colabdesign package:
#     patch -p1 < 01-evoformer-capture.patch
#
# This patch is OPTIONAL. It is needed only to reproduce the
# Evoformer contact-map analysis; all other results run against an
# unmodified ColabDesign.
#
# Three of the four files it modifies are AlphaFold files that
# ColabDesign includes (Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited,
# Apache License 2.0); the fourth, colabdesign/af/model.py, is
# ColabDesign's own (Beer-Ware License). See NOTICE.
#
# It makes layer_stack return each block's output, threads that
# through the AF2 and AF-Multimer Evoformer trunks, and exposes it as
# model.aux['output_iteration']. Keeping 48 blocks of pair
# representation is memory-hungry, so use it on a single target: for a
# 347-residue complex the saved array is 2.8 GB.
#
# 'patch' reports "fuzz 1" on modules.py because of trailing whitespace
# in the context lines; the result is still byte-for-byte correct.
#
